{"id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-tableau-procedure.md","title":"GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure","display":"df-gl-tableau-procedure — GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure","aliases":["89-df-gl-tableau-procedure"],"display":"df-gl-tableau-procedure — GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","[[89-df-effective-computation]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-tableau-procedure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-tableau-procedure — GL Tableau Rewrite Procedure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0e5598f570a6835\" href=\"?note=b0e5598f570a6835\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic\">89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3997bfb78544d69c\" href=\"?note=3997bfb78544d69c\" title=\"89-df-effective-computation\">89-df-effective-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(T,U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；分支 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(\\Gamma_b,E_b,\\mathcal U_b)\">\\(b=(\\Gamma_b,E_b,\\mathcal U_b)\\)</span> 的投影按此等式固定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\beta\">\\(s,\\beta\\)</span> 是有限序列，替换分支时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 非空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[i\\mapsto x]\">\\(s[i\\mapsto x]\\)</span> 是保长单点更新；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{[a,b)}=\\langle s_{a+j}\\mid j&lt;b-a\\rangle\">\\(s_{[a,b)}=\\langle s_{a+j}\\mid j&lt;b-a\\rangle\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le a\\le b\\le|s|\">\\(0\\le a\\le b\\le|s|\\)</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{flat}\">\\(\\mathsf{flat}\\)</span> 为下述序列连接折叠。地址按自然数有限序列的字典序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\ell}\">\\(&lt;_{\\ell}\\)</span> 比较；所有最小值都只在非空有限集合上取。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是规则接口的门控参数：正式规则使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 仅用于既有反例中的旧规则。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\delta\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为策略优先级；命题规则优先级为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，窗口规则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>规则不会改写新加公式的内部结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Open}\">\\(\\mathsf{Open}\\)</span> 仅对实际被重写的分支作原有检查，不额外引入祖先守卫。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{flat}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{flat}(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{flat}(s)\\mathbin{\\frown}t,\\\\\nb[s;k]&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma_b\\mathbin{\\frown}s,E_b\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U_b),\\\\\n\\mathsf D(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf D(\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf D(\\Gamma)\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle C\\rangle,&amp;A=\\Box C,\\\\\n\\mathsf D(\\Gamma),&amp;A\\notin\\{\\Box C\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\vec D_b&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf D(\\Gamma_b),\\quad\n\\sigma(C,b)\\coloneqq\\langle\\neg C,\\Box C\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathsf{flat}(\\langle\\langle(\\vec D_b)_i,\\Box(\\vec D_b)_i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;|\\vec D_b|\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Br}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j\\rangle\\mid j&lt;|T|\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a\\mid j&lt;|T|,u&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T_j}|,a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u))\\},\\\\\nT|\\langle j\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq T_j,\\quad\nT|(\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a)\\coloneqq\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u)|a,\\\\\nT[\\langle j\\rangle:=\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq T_{[0,j)}\\mathbin{\\frown}\\beta\\mathbin{\\frown}T_{[j+1,|T|)},\\\\\nT[\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a:=\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq\nT[j\\mapsto(\\Gamma_{T_j},E_{T_j},\\mathcal U_{T_j}[u\\mapsto\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u)[a:=\\beta]])],\\\\\n\\mathsf{PReady}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b\\\n\\neg\\exists B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n[\\Gamma_b(k)=(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg(B\\land C))\\lor\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\neg B)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Evt}_{\\varepsilon}(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle B,C\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(B\\land C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle\\neg B\\rangle;k],b[\\langle\\neg C\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg(B\\land C))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle B\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\neg B)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(1,k,\\langle(\\Gamma_b,E_b\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U_b\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\langle(\\sigma(C,b),\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle\\rangle)\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\Box C),\\varepsilon=0\\lor\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rules}(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\mid\\exists\\delta,k\\ (\\delta,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{Evt}_1(b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{En}_{\\varepsilon}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\mid a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),\\mathsf{Open}(T|a),(\\delta,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{Evt}_{\\varepsilon}(T|a)\\},\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow U&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T)\\ U=T[a:=\\beta],\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}U&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_0(T)\\ U=T[a:=\\beta],\\\\\ns&lt;_{\\ell}t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall i&lt;|s|\\ s_i=t_i)\\lor\n\\exists j&lt;\\min(|s|,|t|)\\ [(\\forall i&lt;j\\ s_i=t_i)\\land s_j&lt;t_j],\\\\\n(\\delta,a,k)\\prec(\\delta&#39;,a&#39;,k&#39;)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\delta&lt;\\delta&#39;\\lor(\\delta=\\delta&#39;\\land a&lt;_{\\ell}a&#39;)\\lor(\\delta=\\delta&#39;\\land a=a&#39;\\land k&lt;k&#39;),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Next}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}T,&amp;\\mathsf{En}_1(T)=\\varnothing,\\\\\nT[a:=\\beta],&amp;(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T),\\\n\\neg\\exists(\\delta&#39;,a&#39;,k&#39;,\\beta&#39;)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T)\\ (\\delta&#39;,a&#39;,k&#39;)\\prec(\\delta,a,k),\\end{cases}\\\\\nT_A^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\langle\\neg A\\rangle,\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle,\\quad\nT_A^{m+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Next}(T_A^m)\\quad(m\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{En}_1(T)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{En}_0(T)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Child}_T&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(a,a\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle u,j\\rangle)\\mid\na\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),u&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}|,j&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)|\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{flat}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{flat}(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{flat}(s)\\mathbin{\\frown}t,\\\\\nb[s;k]&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma_b\\mathbin{\\frown}s,E_b\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U_b),\\\\\n\\mathsf D(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf D(\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf D(\\Gamma)\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle C\\rangle,&amp;A=\\Box C,\\\\\n\\mathsf D(\\Gamma),&amp;A\\notin\\{\\Box C\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\vec D_b&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf D(\\Gamma_b),\\quad\n\\sigma(C,b)\\coloneqq\\langle\\neg C,\\Box C\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathsf{flat}(\\langle\\langle(\\vec D_b)_i,\\Box(\\vec D_b)_i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;|\\vec D_b|\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Br}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j\\rangle\\mid j&lt;|T|\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a\\mid j&lt;|T|,u&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T_j}|,a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u))\\},\\\\\nT|\\langle j\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq T_j,\\quad\nT|(\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a)\\coloneqq\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u)|a,\\\\\nT[\\langle j\\rangle:=\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq T_{[0,j)}\\mathbin{\\frown}\\beta\\mathbin{\\frown}T_{[j+1,|T|)},\\\\\nT[\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a:=\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq\nT[j\\mapsto(\\Gamma_{T_j},E_{T_j},\\mathcal U_{T_j}[u\\mapsto\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u)[a:=\\beta]])],\\\\\n\\mathsf{PReady}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b\\\n\\neg\\exists B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n[\\Gamma_b(k)=(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg(B\\land C))\\lor\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\neg B)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Evt}_{\\varepsilon}(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle B,C\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(B\\land C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle\\neg B\\rangle;k],b[\\langle\\neg C\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg(B\\land C))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle B\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\neg B)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(1,k,\\langle(\\Gamma_b,E_b\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U_b\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\langle(\\sigma(C,b),\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle\\rangle)\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\Box C),\\varepsilon=0\\lor\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rules}(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\mid\\exists\\delta,k\\ (\\delta,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{Evt}_1(b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{En}_{\\varepsilon}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\mid a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),\\mathsf{Open}(T|a),(\\delta,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{Evt}_{\\varepsilon}(T|a)\\},\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow U&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T)\\ U=T[a:=\\beta],\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}U&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_0(T)\\ U=T[a:=\\beta],\\\\\ns&lt;_{\\ell}t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall i&lt;|s|\\ s_i=t_i)\\lor\n\\exists j&lt;\\min(|s|,|t|)\\ [(\\forall i&lt;j\\ s_i=t_i)\\land s_j&lt;t_j],\\\\\n(\\delta,a,k)\\prec(\\delta&#39;,a&#39;,k&#39;)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\delta&lt;\\delta&#39;\\lor(\\delta=\\delta&#39;\\land a&lt;_{\\ell}a&#39;)\\lor(\\delta=\\delta&#39;\\land a=a&#39;\\land k&lt;k&#39;),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Next}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}T,&amp;\\mathsf{En}_1(T)=\\varnothing,\\\\\nT[a:=\\beta],&amp;(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T),\\\n\\neg\\exists(\\delta&#39;,a&#39;,k&#39;,\\beta&#39;)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T)\\ (\\delta&#39;,a&#39;,k&#39;)\\prec(\\delta,a,k),\\end{cases}\\\\\nT_A^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\langle\\neg A\\rangle,\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle,\\quad\nT_A^{m+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Next}(T_A^m)\\quad(m\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{En}_1(T)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{En}_0(T)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Child}_T&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(a,a\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle u,j\\rangle)\\mid\na\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),u&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}|,j&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)|\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.141–143（编码及确定调度为本目录规约）。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>集合构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 统一遍历 Hypothesis 的未检查位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 遍历公式集。规则是元层的有限树重写；不是额外的 GL 对象语言公理。</p>\n<p>固定有效公式树编码，在每个非终止状态先选命题规则，再选模态规则，同类中取最小地址及最小位置。这给出确定的饱和策略。新窗口内先处理命题联结词；闭分支不再展开。原书 pp.139、142 先作命题展开，再作模态展开；这里将本分支的命题优先条件正式写入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}\\)</span>，采用一个明确的饱和策略。</p>\n<p>复制分支时同时复制窗口记录和已检查位置；出现地址重新按当前树排序。命题字母、负字母、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg\\bot\">\\(\\bot,\\neg\\bot\\)</span>、正盒均无展开规则。生成的每个正盒属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\)</span> 仅表示本分支的三个命题规则已全部处理；字母、负字母、底及正盒不要求检查标记。首次建窗口以后，父分支不再增加公式，后续模态步只改变检查集及窗口序列，所以每个窗口继承的正盒清单就是父分支的最终正盒清单。不能只在 Remark 规定策略却让 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> 允许任意顺序；去掉该守卫的明确反例见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cdecf2529365d61b\" href=\"?note=cdecf2529365d61b\" title=\"89-ex-gl-tableau-order\">89-ex-gl-tableau-order</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"b0e5598f570a6835","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-effective-computation","status":"resolved","id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-ex-gl-tableau-order","status":"resolved","id":"cdecf2529365d61b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PReady}(b)$ 仅表示本分支的三个命题规则已全部处理；字母、负字母、底及正盒不要求检查标记。首次建窗口以后，父分支不再增加公式，后续模态步只改变检查集及窗口序列，所以每个窗口继承的正盒清单就是父分支的最终正盒清单。不能只在 Remark 规定策略却让 $\\Rightarrow$ 允许任意顺序；去掉该守卫的明确反例见 [[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,U\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"b=(\\Gamma_b,E_b,\\mathcal U_b)","display":false},{"tex":"s,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"s[i\\mapsto x]","display":false},{"tex":"s_{[a,b)}=\\langle s_{a+j}\\mid j<b-a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le a\\le b\\le|s|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{flat}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Open}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{flat}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf{flat}(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{flat}(s)\\mathbin{\\frown}t,\\\\\nb[s;k]&\\coloneqq(\\Gamma_b\\mathbin{\\frown}s,E_b\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U_b),\\\\\n\\mathsf D(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\quad\n\\mathsf D(\\Gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf D(\\Gamma)\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle C\\rangle,&A=\\Box C,\\\\\n\\mathsf D(\\Gamma),&A\\notin\\{\\Box C\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\vec D_b&\\coloneqq\\mathsf D(\\Gamma_b),\\quad\n\\sigma(C,b)\\coloneqq\\langle\\neg C,\\Box C\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\mathsf{flat}(\\langle\\langle(\\vec D_b)_i,\\Box(\\vec D_b)_i\\rangle\\mid i<|\\vec D_b|\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Br}(T)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j\\rangle\\mid j<|T|\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a\\mid j<|T|,u<|\\mathcal U_{T_j}|,a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u))\\},\\\\\nT|\\langle j\\rangle&\\coloneqq T_j,\\quad\nT|(\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a)\\coloneqq\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u)|a,\\\\\nT[\\langle j\\rangle:=\\beta]&\\coloneqq T_{[0,j)}\\mathbin{\\frown}\\beta\\mathbin{\\frown}T_{[j+1,|T|)},\\\\\nT[\\langle j,u\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}a:=\\beta]&\\coloneqq\nT[j\\mapsto(\\Gamma_{T_j},E_{T_j},\\mathcal U_{T_j}[u\\mapsto\\mathcal U_{T_j}(u)[a:=\\beta]])],\\\\\n\\mathsf{PReady}(b)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b\\\n\\neg\\exists B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n[\\Gamma_b(k)=(B\\land C)\\lor\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg(B\\land C))\\lor\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\neg B)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Evt}_{\\varepsilon}(b)&\\coloneqq\n\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle B,C\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(B\\land C)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle\\neg B\\rangle;k],b[\\langle\\neg C\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg(B\\land C))\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{(0,k,\\langle b[\\langle B\\rangle;k]\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\neg B)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{(1,k,\\langle(\\Gamma_b,E_b\\cup\\{k\\},\\mathcal U_b\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\langle\\langle(\\sigma(C,b),\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle\\rangle)\\rangle)\\mid\nk\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma_b)\\setminus E_b,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\Gamma_b(k)=(\\neg\\Box C),\\varepsilon=0\\lor\\mathsf{PReady}(b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rules}(b)&\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\mid\\exists\\delta,k\\ (\\delta,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{Evt}_1(b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{En}_{\\varepsilon}(T)&\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\mid a\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),\\mathsf{Open}(T|a),(\\delta,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{Evt}_{\\varepsilon}(T|a)\\},\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow U&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T)\\ U=T[a:=\\beta],\\\\\nT\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}U&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_0(T)\\ U=T[a:=\\beta],\\\\\ns<_{\\ell}t&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(|s|<|t|\\land\\forall i<|s|\\ s_i=t_i)\\lor\n\\exists j<\\min(|s|,|t|)\\ [(\\forall i<j\\ s_i=t_i)\\land s_j<t_j],\\\\\n(\\delta,a,k)\\prec(\\delta',a',k')&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\delta<\\delta'\\lor(\\delta=\\delta'\\land a<_{\\ell}a')\\lor(\\delta=\\delta'\\land a=a'\\land k<k'),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Next}(T)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}T,&\\mathsf{En}_1(T)=\\varnothing,\\\\\nT[a:=\\beta],&(\\delta,a,k,\\beta)\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T),\\\n\\neg\\exists(\\delta',a',k',\\beta')\\in\\mathsf{En}_1(T)\\ (\\delta',a',k')\\prec(\\delta,a,k),\\end{cases}\\\\\nT_A^0&\\coloneqq\\langle(\\langle\\neg A\\rangle,\\varnothing,\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle,\\quad\nT_A^{m+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Next}(T_A^m)\\quad(m\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{En}_1(T)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{En}_0(T)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Child}_T&\\coloneqq\n\\{(a,a\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle u,j\\rangle)\\mid\na\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),u<|\\mathcal U_{T|a}|,j<|\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)|\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"B,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false}],"bytes":6573,"backlinks":[{"id":"cdecf2529365d61b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}},\\mathsf{Sat}_{\\mathrm{raw}}$ 精确取 [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] 的 $\\varepsilon=0$ 接口；$\\Rightarrow_{\\mathrm{raw}}^*$ 使用有限路径闭包。"},{"id":"b271bf5e7002b205","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fb687bda8415ad17","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；$T_k=T_A^k$ 是 [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] 定义的全迭代序列，饱和后保持原值。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89